      "finding": "The process for generating URL slugs from filenames may not handle collisions, such as identical filenames in different subdirectories. This would cause one page to silently overwrite another during the build, resulting in data loss and broken links across the generated site.",
      "required_closure": "mitigate",
      "status": "open",
      "closure": {}
    }
  ],
  "closure_pass": false
}

