npredictably.", "mitigation": {"text": "Define a deterministic slug strategy (include path segments and/or stable hashing). Detect collisions during build and fail with actionable errors unless an explicit override map is provided.", "owner": "Engineering", "status": "planned"}, "acceptance": null}, {"id": "K6", "severity": "high", "description": "Non-deterministic builds (ordering differences, locale/time-dependent formatting, unpinned dependencies) produce noisy diffs and inconsistent site output across machines/CI.", "mitigation": {"text": "Enforce determinism: stable sorting of inputs, fixed locale/timezone handling, content-hash-based asset naming, and pinned dependency versions/lockfiles. Add a reproducibility check comparing outputs across two clean runs.", "owner": "Engineering", "status": "planned"}, "acceptance": null}, {"id": "K7", "severity": "high", "description": "Markdown flavor/extension mismatch or unsupported/non-standard syntax yields rendering differences, broken formatting, or build failures relative to user expectations.", "mitigation": {"text": "Select and document a supported Markdown flavor and extensions (e.g., CommonMark baseline with explicit GFM extensions if supported). Add a conformance test pack with representative notes, robust error handling, and a strict mode that flags unsupported syntax.", "owner": "Product/Engineering", "status": "planned"}, "acceptance": null}, {"id": "K8", "severity": "medium", "description": "File encoding and Unicode handling issues (non-UTF8, BOM, mixed line endings) cause build failures or corrupted output text/search results.", "mitigation": {"text": "Assume UTF-8 by default but detect/handle BOM and common encodings where feasible. Normalize line endings internally. Emit clear diagnostics identifying offending files and provide a preflight validation command.", "owner": "Engineering", "status": "planned"}, "acceptance": null}, {"id": "K9", "severity": "high", "description": "Path traversal or unintended 